========================================================================
FRESHFIND - LOCAL FARMERS MARKETS & PRODUCE GUIDE
PROJECT README & SUBMISSION DOCUMENT
========================================================================

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
-------------------
FreshFind is a lightweight, responsive React.js Single Page Application (SPA) designed to help community shoppers discover local farmers markets, view verified operating schedules, explore seasonal produce, and plan fresh food visits in Karachi, Pakistan.

2. MANDATORY INSTALLATION & EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS
---------------------------------------------------
Follow these straightforward steps to run the application on any PC with Node.js:

Step 1: Open Terminal or Command Prompt in the project folder:
        cd FreshFind_React_UI_Fixed

Step 2: Install dependencies:
        npm install

Step 3: Run the local development server:
        npm run dev

Step 4: Open your web browser and navigate to the local address displayed:
        http://localhost:5173/

Production Build (Optional):
        npm run build
        npm run preview

